<h1>Reform options: how the yearly increase could change</h1>

<p class="lede">Two separate decisions are often discussed together. One is how the State Pension should rise each year. The other is who should be entitled to it. This page sets out the options for the yearly increase. The next page has a calculator to compare them. The other pages in this section cover what the State Pension costs and who is affected, pensions and social care, and entitlement.</p>

