{% call m.note("Why this rule is not in the calculator", 4) %}
<p>The proposals for a smoothed link differ in three details. They are the target level, how the pension catches up after a year of price protection, and over how long. Until those are set, a calculation would be our invention. The rule is described here and left out of the comparison below. The rule announced for April 2030 is in the comparison, with its assumptions labelled.</p>
{% endcall %}

<p>A freeze, with no increase at all, is not among the options. We found no current proposal for one.</p>

